Reason: with APPLICATION_SERVER_URL_ENFORCE ON, a saved --overrideserverurl or a command-line account setup
(--serverurl/--userid/--apppassword) must not connect the client to any server other than the compiled-in URL.
Against nextcloud/desktop v34.0.5 (62ebad6043b1e7c8e319f41be25d41f5a2c733e5). No effect when enforcement is off.
